  "post_content": "<div style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px;\">El&nbsp;<b style=\"font-size: 12.8px;\">1160&nbsp;</b><span style=\"font-size: 12.8px;\">es el n&uacute;mero agraciado en el sorteo de un fin de semana para dos personas en&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.8px;\">Marina d&acute;Or. Se ha&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.8px;\">vendido en el Laboratorio de Marisa Cerezo. </span></div>\n<div style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/05/IMG_7426.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></div>\n<div style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.8px;\">L</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.8px;\">a Asociaci&oacute;n Castell&oacute;n contra el C&aacute;ncer (ACCC) quiere dar las gracias a todas las Personas asistentes a la marcha, al Ayuntamiento de Onda, Protecci&oacute;n Civil, Polic&iacute;a Local, comercios colaboradores y voluntarias por la colaboracion recibida para poder realizar este evento.</span></div>\n<div style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px;\"></div>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/marxasolidariaaccc2016/img_7400.jpg\" alt=\"img_7400\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/marxasolidariaaccc2016/img_7401.jpg\" alt=\"img_7401\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/marxasolidariaaccc2016/img_7402.jpg\" alt=\"img_7402\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/marxasolidariaaccc2016/img_7403.jpg\" alt=\"img_7403\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/marxasolidariaaccc2016/img_7404.jpg\" alt=\"i